<title>SINGAPORE: RESEARCH ALERT-Fraser says &quot;buy&quot; EEI.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Fraser says &quot;buy&quot; EEI.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fraser Securities upgraded its recommendation for shares in printed circuit board (PCB) and component maker Elec and Eltek International Co (Elec) to &quot;buy&quot; on Wednesday on the basis of the company's annual results.</p>
<p>Fraser had earlier recommended the shares as &quot;buy on weakness&quot;.</p>
</text>
